==Portuguese==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|pt|porq̃||obsolete|abbreviation}}
* {{alt|pt|pq||Internet slang}}
* {{alt|pt|perque||obsolete}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|pt|roa-opt|porque}}, corresponding to {{compound|pt|por|que|t1=for|t2=that}}.

Cognate with {{cog|gl,es|porque}}, {{cog|ca|perquè}}, {{cog|fr|parce que}} and {{cog|it|perché}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{pt-IPA|pt=pụrque|br=purquê}}
* {{IPA|pt|/puɻ.ˈke/|a=Caipira}}
* {{IPA|pt|/poɹ.ˈke/|/poɾ.ˈke/|a=South Brazil}}
* {{hyphenation|pt|por|que}}

===Conjunction===
{{head|pt|conjunction}}

# [[because]]; [[for]] {{gloss|''introduces an explanation to the claim in the previous clause''}}
#: {{syn|pt|pois|que}}
#: {{ux|pt|Aproveita a vida '''porque''' ela é curta!|Enjoy life '''because''' it is short!}}

